# Sensitive files — credential-SHAPED filenames only (narrowed 2026-07-25, Will-approved).
# The old bare substring globs *secret*/*token* silently swallowed legitimate research/memory
# files that merely DISCUSS tokens/secrets (state tokens, secret scanning, …) — repo-wide, and
# silently when a tool writes to disk without staging. See
# PROME/inbox/2026-07-25_from-WALTER_gitignore-sensitive-glob-silently-orphans-a-fleet-memory.md.
# After editing this block, re-audit: git ls-files --others --ignored --exclude-standard | grep -iv .venv
*.key
*.pem
*.token
*.secret
token.json
tokens.json
secrets.json
secrets.yaml
secrets.yml
client_secret*
*_token.json
*_secret.json
.env
.env.*

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Temp files
*.tmp
*.swp
*~

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Node
node_modules/

# Logs that shouldn't be versioned
*.log
.venv/

# Windows download metadata
*:Zone.Identifier

# Bank primary source materials — local only (PDFs, 10-K HTML dumps, quarterly supplements)
# In quarter dirs: exclude every file by default, then allow .md text (synthesis + transcripts).
# Note: cannot exclude the dir itself — git won't traverse into ignored dirs, breaking the negation.
AGENTS/REGINALD/*/sources/*.pdf
AGENTS/REGINALD/*/sources/10k_*/
AGENTS/REGINALD/*/sources/q[1-4]_*/*
!AGENTS/REGINALD/*/sources/q[1-4]_*/*.md
# WAL promoted out of REGINALD 2026-07-25 (Will-approved 7/22, ruling 4: same-changelist as the git mv) — same semantics at the new path
AGENTS/WAL/sources/*.pdf
AGENTS/WAL/sources/10k_*/
AGENTS/WAL/sources/q[1-4]_*/*
!AGENTS/WAL/sources/q[1-4]_*/*.md
# REGINALD per-bank subtree archived 2026-08-13 (Will-approved retirement R2) — the single-* rules above match one path segment, so the move un-ignored ~17 binaries; same semantics at the archive path (REGINALD flagged, PROME applied per the WAL same-changelist precedent). ⚠ git mv silently re-scopes depth-anchored ignore rules — git status immediately after any tree move.
AGENTS/REGINALD/archive/per-bank/*/sources/*.pdf
AGENTS/REGINALD/archive/per-bank/*/sources/*.xlsx
AGENTS/REGINALD/archive/per-bank/*/sources/10k_*/
AGENTS/REGINALD/archive/per-bank/*/sources/q[1-4]_*/*
!AGENTS/REGINALD/archive/per-bank/*/sources/q[1-4]_*/*.md

# Local large/source artifacts — keep raw statutory PDFs out of Git
AGENTS/SHADE/sources/athene_statutory_2026-06-15/*.pdf
AGENTS/SHADE/research/tmp_aaia_extract/venv/

# Sensitive material removed in the 2026-06 public-prep scrub — keep it out for good
WILL/trading-journal/
# Will-personal local-only zone (Will-directed 2026-08-18, in-session) — never pushed.
# Machine-local by construction: does NOT travel desktop<->laptop. Inventory pointer
# lives in PROME/MACHINE_LOCAL.md per the gitignored-AND-boot-surfaced pairing rule.
WILL/private/
*.pkl
